An electric vehicle (EV) charging network consists of several charging stations connected through roads or other routes. 
Each charging station is represented as a vertex, and each connection between two stations is represented as an edge 
in a graph.

Develop a C++ program that represents the EV charging network using a graph and applies Depth First Search (DFS) from 
a selected starting station. The program should display the traversal order, list all reachable stations, and identify 
stations that are unreachable from the selected station.
